WEBVTT

00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:09.958
[gasps]

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:13.041
[gasps]
"Not ready yet"?

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.875
Wait. Coach already decided?

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:17.250
We're not making the team?

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:19.500
No. We have one day left.

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.000
What do we do? What can we do?

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:22.416
-Okay, okay, okay.
-What would Val do?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.666
Uh, well, we're just gonna
have to change Coach's mind.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.291
Which means
we're gonna need ideas.

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.500
Lots of them.

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.625
[thunder rumbles distantly]

00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:33.250
-[thunder rumbling]
-Ow!

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:38.458
Oh, no. It's a Brainstorm!

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.541
-[all screaming]
-[Fear] Too close!

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.083
Hog the puck?

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.250
Trash talk the other team?

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.666
-[laughing] Ooh!
-Yes!

00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:54.708
We can't let these bad ideas
get to Riley. [grunts]

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:56.125
Joy!

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.916
[rumbling]

00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:00.250
-Smash as many as you can!
-Joy!

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:03.083
Joy!

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:04.375
[all screaming]

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:11.458
I'll start sorting these into
ideas I wish I'd thought of.

00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:13.625
Oh, no, no, no.
None of these are good enough.

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:15.541
We need more. Get more!

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:17.625
[grunting]

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:19.375
Get on the balloon!

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:21.291
[grunting] Whoa!

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:23.708
[grunting, spits]

00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:25.833
This is worse
than the broccoli!

00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:26.916
[breathing heavily]

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:31.250
[gasps] Quick! Grab an idea.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.666
[grunts, screams]

00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:35.708
-Whoa!
-These ideas are too small.

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:37.291
These ideas are too small!

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:38.958
We need something bigger.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.500
[gasps]

00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:44.541
That's our way out!

00:01:44.625 --> 00:01:45.625
[panting]

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:51.083
Ready?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.000
-[Joy grunts]
-[all screaming]

00:01:58.291 --> 00:02:00.541
Joy! We need this idea!

00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:01.791
If Riley takes
one of these ideas,

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:03.208
it could be a disaster!

00:02:03.375 --> 00:02:05.458
Joy, the only way out is up.

00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:10.125
[all screaming]

00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:15.583
[all grunt]

00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:19.333
[thuds]

00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:21.958
That's a big idea!

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.125
Whoa! I like it.

00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:26.500
-Oh, no.
-[all screaming]

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.125
Hold me!

00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:34.125
-Seriously. Hold me!
-[Disgust screaming]

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.041
[Anger screaming]

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.833
[Disgust] Fear,
you have a parachute?

00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:39.916
[Fear] Uh, yes.

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:41.875
The real question is,
why don't any of you?

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:43.166
[Disgust laughs]

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.416
-[Fear] Land! Yes!
-[Disgust] Yes!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.958
-[Fear] Stuck the landing!
-We did it!

00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:48.083
-We made it!
-[Anger laughing]

00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:50.250
Come on,
to the Back of the Mind!

00:02:50.416 --> 00:02:52.416
You're finished, Anxiety!

00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:55.208
[warbling weakly]

00:02:55.291 --> 00:02:57.166
Coach is right.
Riley isn't ready.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.750
But we're so close
to a new Riley who is.

00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:02.125
This is what we're missing.

00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:06.791
We show them we're a Fire Hawk
who will do whatever it takes.

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:09.208
[♪ thrilling music playing]

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.916
Finally, we're one of them!

00:03:31.083 --> 00:03:32.375
What do you think, Sadness?

00:03:32.541 --> 00:03:33.708
-Well, I...
-Awesome!

00:03:34.041 --> 00:03:35.250
[Envy]
Red is really our color.

00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:36.541
[Bree] Yeah, no,

00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:37.833
I mean, it's so much fun.

00:03:42.416 --> 00:03:43.416
[Bree chuckling]

00:03:43.916 --> 00:03:46.625
Okay, it's giving jealousy.
I'm sorry.

00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:47.833
[scoffs]
They wouldn't know cool

00:03:47.916 --> 00:03:49.208
if it hit them in the face.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.000
[Valentina]
Hey, Michigan.

00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:53.458
Oh! Rocking the red, huh?

00:03:53.541 --> 00:03:55.583
-Yes!
-We are in.

00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:57.125
[chuckles] I hope it's okay.

00:03:57.291 --> 00:03:58.833
I know I'm not officially
a Fire Hawk yet,

00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:00.333
but I figured since we're
on the same team

00:04:00.416 --> 00:04:01.458
we should match, right?

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:02.666
Yeah, yeah, that's fine.

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:04.291
Did you, um, sleep last night?

00:04:04.458 --> 00:04:06.666
No, how could I?
Big game today!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.250
You mean the camp scrimmage?

00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:10.666
See? I told you
not to freak her out.

00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:12.958
You're all good, okay?
I see you're in your zone.

00:04:13.125 --> 00:04:14.916
Get ready to score some goals.

00:04:15.083 --> 00:04:16.416
Yeah! I will!

00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:18.166
Val scored two goals
in the scrimmage

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.250
to become a Fire Hawk.

00:04:19.416 --> 00:04:21.000
And you know
what's better than two?

00:04:21.166 --> 00:04:22.166
-Three!
-Three!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.333
I was just about to say that.

00:04:23.416 --> 00:04:24.958
We were about to say that
at the same time.

00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:28.083
But how are we gonna score
three goals?

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.208
The new Riley
will handle anything.

00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:33.041
And I think this
is the finishing touch.

00:04:33.916 --> 00:04:35.208
[panel chimes]

00:04:36.291 --> 00:04:37.375
I'll be right back.

00:04:41.208 --> 00:04:42.583
[grunting]

00:04:42.666 --> 00:04:43.666
Come on!

00:04:43.958 --> 00:04:45.125
-We're so close.
-[all grunting]

00:04:45.208 --> 00:04:47.750
The Sense of Self is just
on top of that mount... [gasps]

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:53.291
That is a lot.

00:04:53.458 --> 00:04:55.583
This is more than I remember
sending back here.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.333
Oh, when she walked into

00:04:57.416 --> 00:04:59.083
that glass door at that party.
Oof!

00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:01.583
Yeah, and breaking
Grandma's favorite plate.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.791
Thank goodness
these aren't part of her.

00:05:03.875 --> 00:05:05.333
-[Fear] Phew!
-[Disgust] Oh, yeah.

00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:06.666
[giggling]

00:05:09.791 --> 00:05:12.583
[crackling]

00:05:14.708 --> 00:05:15.708
[squeals]

00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:20.291
[grunts] There it is.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.583
[grunting]

00:05:24.458 --> 00:05:25.458
[warbling]

00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:29.291
[Riley echoing]
I'm a good person...

00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:30.625
Oh, no.

00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:39.250
[Anxiety panting]

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.416
Yes. Come on, come on.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.625
Here we go!

00:05:46.625 --> 00:05:47.708
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.250
What?

00:05:50.333 --> 00:05:52.625
[echoing] I'm not good enough.

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:54.166
[ground rumbling]

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.958
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:05:57.875 --> 00:05:59.375
-[Embarrassment whimpering]
-Are you sure...

00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:00.458
Don't worry.

00:06:00.541 --> 00:06:01.541
It's just that she knows that
there's always room

00:06:01.625 --> 00:06:02.666
for self-improvement.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.750
She'll be fine.

00:06:06.333 --> 00:06:08.000
Sadness,
we have the Sense of Self.

00:06:08.083 --> 00:06:09.166
[over radio] Bring us back!

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.375
-Sadness, do you copy?
-[struggling]

00:06:11.291 --> 00:06:12.833
Psst. Psst!

00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:16.083
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:06:21.208 --> 00:06:22.208
Oh...

00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:26.625
Okay, I can work with this.

00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:27.875
I just need to recalibrate

00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:29.125
the console and make sure
it's ready.

00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:30.708
Just no more surprises.

00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:33.333
Okay, this one goes here.
Check.

00:06:33.416 --> 00:06:34.625
That one goes there.
Check.

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.083
Not exactly there.
Here.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.708
Come on.
Turn it up a little bit.

00:06:37.791 --> 00:06:39.291
It's got to be
absolutely perfect.

00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:41.458
That one is definitely wrong.
What is happening?

00:06:41.541 --> 00:06:42.875
-[radio chirps]
-[Joy] Sadness, now!

00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:46.916
[screaming]

00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:48.750
[pipes clang]

00:06:50.041 --> 00:06:51.666
[clattering]

00:06:52.791 --> 00:06:53.958
Oh...

00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:55.375
Joy...

00:06:55.458 --> 00:06:57.125
-Oh, no!
-Uh...

00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:58.708
[pipes clattering]

00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:00.958
[all scream]

00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:07.458
[memories clattering]

00:07:15.291 --> 00:07:18.208
[Riley distorted]
I'm a good person.

00:07:18.666 --> 00:07:20.666
[echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.125
That was our only way back.

00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:28.083
-What do we do?
-We were so close.

00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:38.250
Joy. Joy!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.291
Where are you going?

